{"server":"cn","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_st03","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_st03","title":"剜刺","storyCode":"IS-ST-3","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"5d7110804ec2b0b7aac31aee585b04eb1e84f56e55acc68ac5700a3ffd30c051","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"这一天的清晨，一声清脆的铳声，通过广播，传遍了整座沃尔西尼城。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，真的是法官阁下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是卢比奥阁下的女儿，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的......我还以为，父亲跟我说您会来照看我是在开玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和我朋友都特别崇拜您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我父亲那样的人一比，您简直就是政府里唯一的清流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你和卢比奥先生关系不好吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谈不上好不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是挺喜欢父亲的，因为他时间总是很多，经常陪我玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，现在我也觉得，父亲这样只知道所谓明哲保身的人，实在是太没有志气了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经和他一起从基层做起的同僚，现在都飞黄腾达了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有他到了这个岁数才混了一个边缘的职位，而且一点上进心都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他曾经的同僚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，前阵子死掉的那个建设部部长卡拉奇就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是个危险的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道......但是，我天天都能在电视上看到那个人，而且大家族的人都会对他有所礼让。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不觉得，如果要当官的话，就得做到那种地步才有意义吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，父亲这次忽然接任了建设部部长的位置，我其实是很惊讶的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道他怎么就忽然开窍了......要是他早点这么做，母亲也不会和他离婚了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离婚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，母亲也觉得父亲太窝囊了，所以前几年和他离婚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我母亲性格也不太好，所以我最后还是选择了跟着父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，法官阁下，您一定知道父亲是怎么被选为建设部部长的吧，跟我说说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您在房间里随便坐坐吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，我也不打算出去，就打算听一听父亲的就职演讲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（卢比奥部长的房间......比想象中的整洁。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很奇怪吧，父亲看起来是个邋遢的人，其实生活很规律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，他还有写日记的习惯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"日记？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，我记得，对了，就摆在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说是日记，其实我看他是想到了才会写一点上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些年断断续续加起来也就写了这么一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随便看没关系吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，父亲放在这里，就是不介意别人看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看过几次，上面写的都是些无聊的东西，要我说呀，就是一本活脱脱的中年男人生活实录，枯燥又冗长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要是有兴趣，尽管看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"3月5日\n餐厅偶遇卡拉奇，久违地一起小酌了一杯。\n念及往事，不禁潸然泪下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢比奥先生，这里就是您发表演讲的地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都出去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......我们接到的命令是保护您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有人进得来，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝洛内家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，权力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用沙发把门堵住......能做的也就只有这么多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡拉奇，再等我一会儿，马上我就来陪你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......医生说，对方下手的位置恰好偏离了心脏几厘米，所以没有立刻致死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是情况还是很不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从昨天回来开始就一副失魂落魄的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坐在那里，一动不动，让她吃饭也没有反应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......让她好好想一想吧，我和可颂继续在医院守着，她就交给你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，你们在医院也注意安全。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，好无聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我记得今天好像有什么演讲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听听看好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位亲爱的市民朋友们，你们好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想必你们之中的大部分对我并不了解，这不奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟我在过去担任了食品安全部部长这样一个并不重要的职位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"实际上，我想，大部分市民朋友，除了前任部长卡拉奇以及我们的拉维妮娅法官，恐怕对我们的政府知之甚少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我与法官阁下并不熟，但是，我与卡拉奇前部长，倒是有些交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想，今天的演讲，就从这位大家都熟知的人开始讲起吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我与卡拉奇是同期进入市场监管局的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他身强力壮，精力充沛，负责实地考察，而我则在后方进行一些文书工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他在当时就以敢说敢做而闻名系统内，连大家族他都敢惹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说实在的，他也算是命硬，有好几次差点就被对他不满的家族给除掉了，要么被他躲了过去，要么被他扛了下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"总之，当时，局里都把他当做一个刺头，没人想帮他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"于是，给他上报工作的任务，就丢给了同样不受待见的我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"给他上报工作，可是费了我好大的功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是，做这项工作又给了我一些成就感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我没有办法像他那样直接，但是他替我做了我想做的事，我能在这方面帮衬他，也算是一种回报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一来二去的，我们也算是熟络了起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂，你这两年也在卡拉奇身边做事，我知道你对他评价很高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你所知道的他，是什么样的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他是一个很有活力的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他知道如何应付家族，而且他并不是单纯地圆滑，他知道如何在巧妙地让家族得到好处的同时，让他们为他的目的服务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"许多事情原本会受到诸多来自不同家族的阻碍，到了他手上，总是能被一一办妥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看得出来，你的行事手段，受到了他不小影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是觉得，他的做法和我的想法有相似的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在已经不再是打打杀杀能够解决问题的时代了，父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族如果想要顺应时代，应当做出相应的改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂，你还是不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你下意识地把自己和拉维妮娅还有卡拉奇放在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但永远不要忘记，你和他们不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的知道，你就不会站在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，已经没有时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂，如果你能活下来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罢了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过，他虽然是许多家族的眼中钉，但能力之强，也是大家有目共睹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"于是，他还是远早在我之前得到了晋升。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"实际上，我当时以为，他晋升后会死得很快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因为我始终觉得，他之前是在一个不触及太多利益的地方，所以没招致真正的杀身之祸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是随着他的地位上升，他如果还是那副样子，那一定会惹到惹不起的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我错了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我从来都不知道，父亲原来是这么健谈的一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您觉得呢，法官阁下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官阁下？"},{"type":"narration","text":"卢比奥的女儿发现，拉维妮娅完全没有注意到她的呼唤。\n她全神贯注地投入在了阅读手中的日记上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"5月3日\n......\n解决了一桩小事，有感而发。\n有一个问题是所有人都没有察觉的，或者说，视而不见的。\n为什么，即使来到了西西里夫人的时代，叙拉古依然是表里两套秩序共存？\n家族的粗暴与贪婪早已被历史证实，而粗暴与贪婪如他们，却选择了不由自己来掌控这一切。\n这其中是存在理由的。\n而这个理由，事实上也非常简单。\n人口。\n家族的建立基于血缘或人格上的认同。\n而这种低效率的方式，注定了一个家族的人数规模永远无法达到一个足以管理哪怕是一座移动城市的量级。\n这使得他们必须依赖于由普通人建立的体系，他们只能通过在背后操控这个体系来完成对叙拉古这样一个庞然大物的控制。\n西西里夫人显然意识到了这一点，所以，她在上台后，更为明确地划分了家族与普通人的界限。\n而她通过强调自身绝对的武力以及掌控力，在这几十年中，让所有人都认为，在叙拉古，“表里两套秩序的存在是理所当然的”。\n以至于所有人都被迫遗忘了一个事实，叙拉古的地下秩序之所以能够成立，竟是因为地上秩序的自洽。\n这不可谓不是一种政治智慧的体现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢比奥，你究竟......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"实际上，在我们的系统里，并不乏与卡拉奇拥有相同初衷的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，因为各种各样的原因，他们在最后选择了向家族屈服，甚至谄媚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但卡拉奇不同，他不仅没有屈服，反而时刻在寻找着与他们对抗的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而他的努力是有价值的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他不仅没有如我所想地轻易死去，反而越爬越高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而当我们在某个宴会上重逢时，他对我说了一句我至今记忆犹新的话——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“如今的家族是软弱的。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个大叔胆子还挺大的嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......德克萨斯，外面好像有点状况，我去确认一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得，如果我们把乔万娜带回龙门，怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得她是个很有趣的人欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——我也觉得，你不是这么想的哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"德克萨斯将视线转向窗边的桌子，那里摆放着一条项链。\n那是西西里夫人的信物。\n乔万娜为她留下的礼物。\n在爷爷眼中，哥伦比亚的家族们是变味了的。\n他们为了利益，可以染指那些毫无底线的产业，可以去进行没有道义可言的谋杀。\n在父亲眼中，叙拉古的家族们是腐朽的。\n放着唾手可得的利益不去争取，仅仅是为了所谓的道义限制自己的脚步，只能被称为愚蠢。\n而在德克萨斯看来，爷爷和父亲都是正确的，又都是错误的。\n如果，如果她只是愤怒于乔万娜的遭遇。\n那她可以像七年前那样离开，只是这一次，她会带上乔万娜。\n但是，当她得知爷爷的死讯时，当她对那名洗车工视而不见时，当她对父亲求助的命令视而不见时，她心中想的是——\n这一切似乎没有尽头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他向我展示了他应付家族成员的方法，他的手段简单到令人发笑——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他给出了他们无法拒绝的货物，以及利益。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"家族们并非不能强占他所拥有的渠道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然而，一个优秀的管理者是他们所缺少的，他们只知掠夺，却从来不知道何为真正的管理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他凭借着自身出色的能力，一步一步成了几大家族之间的红人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"并在大家族们因为建设部部长的位置大打出手时，成了那个让所有人都满意的人选。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说到这里，我想会有人提出疑问——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这样听来，卡拉奇似乎和那些左右逢源的人并无区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我想说的是，在叙拉古这样一个国家，在这样一个以恶为基底的国家之中，从一开始，就不可能存在一个好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"偏激一些地说，我们都是邪恶的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这些话，是应该在就职演讲上说的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"10月15日\n与那位拉维妮娅法官见了一面。\n实际上，光听她的一些传闻也能想象，她一定与卡拉奇一样，是一个不愿意掩饰自己的正直之人。\n见面之后果然如此。\n她不会不知道自己的所作所为在当下的环境是徒劳的。\n她不会不知道自己若是真的招致了家族的不满，处境会十分危险——\n当然，这其中讽刺的点又在于，她站在法官立场上试图维护的普通人的权利，在家族看来，不值一提。\n以至于她居然没有被扼杀在前进的道路上。\n与她的交流相当折磨，因为我必须按捺住对她的欣赏，以我一贯的态度对待她。\n卡拉奇曾与我开玩笑说，我的位置令他安心，因为这样他至少知道，自己哪怕死了，也会有我捡起他的遗志。\n但是——如果我也死了呢？\n这些年，我并非没有在培养与拉拢一些年轻人，但他们缺少一个像卡拉奇那样有张力的领导者。\n而拉维妮娅法官无疑是一个理想的接班人。\n我当然不能将我的想法强加于她。\n只是，我的时间恐怕也不多了。\n眼下的机会千载难逢，我没有时间将我的想法一一传达给她。\n但我相信，如果我的计划能够成功，拉维妮娅法官至少会愿意帮我保住我的女儿吧。\n唉，卡拉奇老友，就让我借你的死一用吧。\n若是你我的灵魂还能见面，我再向你道歉。\n——不过，像你这么高洁的灵魂，恐怕和我的去处并不相同吧，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，果然应该趁早转移一下阵地的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过昨天发生了那样的事，也没有办法就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，好厉害的萨科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她只有一个人，围住她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的好搭档现在正在休息，你们能不能安静一点？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真是些喜欢扰民的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，这种时候其他人在，一定会说，“能天使，你也很扰民！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个人好没劲哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来，这里有需要帮助的家伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前就有些好奇了，你这家伙，难道说......很闲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是和你一样，都在等待一个答案罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯回不回龙门对你来说很重要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，现在的话，我希望她回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......那也就是说，你是站在我这边的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正确。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，多一个人总比只有我自己好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i14"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉抱歉，说了一些扫兴的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过，大家应当也发现了，今天，我坐在这里，并不是来发表就职演讲的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是来说一些心里话的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卡拉奇这样一个心怀抱负的人，却从来没有向我表达过他对于新城市的展望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是因为，当他坐上这个位置时，他就已经做好了赴死的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他在这两年里做的事大家是有目共睹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就在我以为他能撑到新城市建立时，他却在前几天那么突然地死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我，终究是咽不下这口气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我接近了贝洛内家族，向他们自荐，获得了这个位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我也在这个过程中，了解到了贝洛内家族与萨卢佐家族的惊天密谋——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们从一开始就计划着搅乱城内的局势，并图谋着夺取新建造的移动城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然后，以此来对抗西西里夫人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，这——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝纳尔多有没有反应？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠诚的家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......贝纳尔多这个老东西，到底在想什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丹布朗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丹布朗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在卢比奥附近吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去解决这个疯癫的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......我猜也拦不住真想进来的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真蠢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做这种事又有什么意义？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的打扮，你平时是工人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我平时在一家洗车店工作，叫“丹布朗洗车店”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，我好像有印象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你叫丹布朗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你对自己的这份工作有什么感想吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叙拉古变得越来越温吞了，我无事可做，才给自己找了点事做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜啊，你应该多看一看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些高高在上的家族成员啊，以为能够永远支配我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们以为，你们的敌人永远只有彼此，而对我们不屑一顾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，时代是在前进的，没有什么是一成不变的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你说得再好听，你所做的也不过是说了几句话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几句话就能推翻家族，推翻西西里夫人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，在这个千载难逢的机会中，我的想法已经传达了出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝纳尔多和西西里夫人谁会赢，我不知道，我也没有兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我所相信的是——时代终将会抛弃你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叙拉古如果注定迎来新的时代，那其中的主角，必定不是名为家族的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有力量，我们确实弱小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，所谓的文明，本就是为了克服暴力而存在的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们追求着一种平等，一种不建立在暴力之上的秩序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暴力才是我们的本能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？那么，为什么所有家族都在向着同一个方向前进？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么他们都在追求着金钱与权力，而非暴力与斗争？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正如，今天在这里杀了我，难道只是一种暴力的宣泄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道不是因为——我妨碍了你背后的人获取权力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你知道答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并且，如果你不介意的话，我希望由我自己来了结自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道这是什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗车工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，几年前通过一些渠道，从黑钢买来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铳不仅使用困难，而且对于好勇斗狠的家族成员来说，这东西也不一定能解决他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最多不过是用来防备和自己一样弱小的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在看来，我早几年就已经想好了，用它来指着谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"卢比奥缓缓将铳口对准自己的太阳穴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，丹布朗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿有一天，你能在叙拉古的土地上，只作为一名洗车工存在，而不必拿起武器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"narration","text":"10月19日\n我多想在演讲中将这些年积压在胸中的一切抒发出来。\n然而我不能。\n我必须让他们相信，我是因为卡拉奇的死而决定报复家族们。\n而且，有些话还太早。\n我并不是为了改变时代而来，我没有那么自大。\n我甚至不相信能有多少人会因此有所启发。\n但我至少相信，这个国家有卡拉奇与我，有拉维妮娅法官这样的人。\n那么这个国家就还有希望。\n于是，权且让我把那些想说的话写在这里吧：\n说了这么多与卡拉奇相关的事，实际上，你们或许发现了，我想说的并不是卡拉奇。\n我想说的是我，是我们，市民朋友们。\n我们生活在一个名为家族的牢笼之中。\n他们并不直接影响我们的生活，却又在我们的生活中无处不在。\n每一个在叙拉古长大的普通人，都会在成长过程中通过各种方式完成自己对家族的认识。\n并最后对此习以为常。\n但是，我希望各位可以看一看身边的人，回顾一下自己的生活。\n我们应当认识到一点——\n我们是活生生的人，我们的生活是真实的，我们不是被圈养的动物。\n而且，我们是拥有力量的。\n我们的力量就是我们创造的生活本身。\n那些家族成员们所享受的生活也是我们创造的。\n这是我们一步一步打造的国家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官小姐，我在做梦吗？父亲，他......居然会那样和一个杀手说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢比奥之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，父亲......他有危险！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉维妮娅感到眼泪湿润了自己的眼眶。\n但她来不及抹掉，因为她心中已经有所预感。\n她走到卢比奥女儿的身边，轻轻捂住了她的耳朵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i14"},{"type":"narration","text":"沃尔西尼的居民永远不会忘记这一天。\n这一天的清晨，一声清脆的铳声，通过广播，传遍了整座沃尔西尼城。\n前沃尔西尼食品安全部部长，卢比奥，在接任建设部部长的就职演讲中身亡。\n随后发生的诸多混乱，虽然仅在半日内就得到了控制，却成了改变叙拉古未来的开端。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
